VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'lets you mutate the interesting requests. So, what makes Yakint different from Burp? Well, the obvious one is Yakit can save you $500 a year. Cool. Sweet. Self high five. Uh, but then on the other note in Burp, you'

[03:46] [scene:talk]
